---
// Full bio, no truncation, display statement first, then the complete text
// (verified against about.html) with inline highlights on the terms that
// carry the throughline: place, school, music, and the two commitments.
---

<section class="bio container" data-wayfinder="Bio">
  <p class="bio__statement">
    As engineers, we hold <mark>real responsibility</mark> over the systems we design,
    from architecture to tooling. That's why I'm committed to honing my craft: writing
    cleaner, faster, and more maintainable solutions that respect both the user and the
    machine.
  </p>

  <div class="bio__body">
    <p class="bio__p measure">
      I'm 20, born in <mark>Braga, Portugal</mark>, currently a third-year Software
      Engineering undergraduate at the <mark>University of Minho</mark>.
    </p>
    <p class="bio__p measure">
      Outside campus I study <mark>jazz guitar</mark>. My favourite genres beyond jazz
      are neo-soul, blues, barber beats, shoegaze, and rock. Inspirations include
      Pat Metheny, Miguel Araújo, Ganso, Pink Floyd, Frank Zappa, Khruangbin, Sade, Masayoshi
      Takanaka, and Casiopea.
    </p>
    <p class="bio__p measure">
      I'm also the co-founder of <mark><a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/0XYxjDhjXN9VEgTs7Z59iq" class="bio__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Solmåne</a></mark>,
      an alternative/indie/rock band, where I arrange, record, and perform original
      material with my fellow peers.
    </p>
    <p class="bio__p measure">
      I believe my passion for this field stems from a childhood fascination with how
      things are built. I wanted to understand what lies behind the abstraction of
      highly advanced, seamless products. I owe this drive to my father, a <mark>software
      engineer</mark> who inspired me to always pursue greatness.
    </p>
    <p class="bio__p measure">
      I always aim to push boundaries, moving forward, keep building things that matter.
      My goal is to pursue a master's in <mark>AI and machine learning</mark> and build
      an international career.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bio {
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
    border-top: var(--rule-hairline) solid var(--color-rule-2);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .bio__statement {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 58ch;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .bio__statement mark {
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-accent) 22%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: 0 0.15em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .bio__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
  }

  .bio__body mark {
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-accent) 22%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: 0 0.15em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .bio__link {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }

  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .bio { grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; align-items: start; }
  }
</style>
